# Deployment environment: non-secret values, safe to commit.
#
# Paths are relative to this repository's root and are expanded to absolute paths by
# scripts/compose-env.sh, because the consumer reads process.env directly and never resolves a
# relative path itself. Write a path here the way you would type it from the repository root.
#
# Names must not begin with DSH_, XDG_, DYLD_ or BASH_FUNC_: app-boot's readEnvLayer() refuses
# those prefixes in any discovered .env (isBootstrapOnly) and exits the runtime, because they
# decide how the process starts. These are ordinary application values, so they carry ordinary
# names and live in a file the repository can own.

# The office-to-pdf provider indexes this directory for document fonts. Chinese government
# templates name 方正小标宋 / 仿宋GB2312 / 楷体GB2312 / 黑体, none of which ship with the
# conversion kit; without it the converter falls back to a Western face and the PDF renders the
# wrong glyphs.
OFFICE_FONT_DIR=packages/office-viewer-fonts/assets/fonts
